{"browser-lab":{"identifier":"browser-lab","description":"Browser lab spike: only the control strip (labbar, a local page) talks to Tauri. The page webview (labpage) renders arbitrary web content and deliberately gets NO capabilities — it is untrusted.","local":true,"windows":["browserlab"],"webviews":["labbar"],"permissions":["core:default","allow-lab-open","allow-lab-navigate","allow-lab-back","allow-lab-forward","allow-lab-reload","allow-lab-current-url"]},"computer-lab":{"identifier":"computer-lab","description":"Computer lab (ADR-0148, M1): the local page that drives the computer tool's commands by hand for the owner's acceptance on Windows. It gets exactly the computer commands and nothing else.","local":true,"windows":["computerlab"],"permissions":["core:default","allow-computer-displays","allow-computer-windows","allow-computer-call","allow-computer-set-grants","allow-computer-preview","allow-computer-embed","allow-computer-unembed"]},"management":{"identifier":"management","description":"The Management window (WSL disk, cache clean, .wslconfig): a served bundle in its own undecorated window, reached from the tray. It gets exactly the management commands plus the window controls its page drives, nothing else. It loads from the daemon's origin, so that origin is listed under remote.","remote":{"urls":["https://localhost:8445","https://127.0.0.1:8445"]},"local":true,"windows":["management"],"permissions":["core:default","core:window:allow-minimize","core:window:allow-maximize","core:window:allow-toggle-maximize","core:window:allow-close","core:window:allow-start-dragging","allow-disk-report","allow-disk-compact","allow-disk-compact-dry-run","allow-host-report","allow-wsl-restart","allow-wsl-update","allow-clean-list","allow-clean-apply","allow-wslconfig-read","allow-wslconfig-write"]},"window-frame":{"identifier":"window-frame","description":"The windows are undecorated: the UI's own chrome drags and closes them. The daemon's origin is listed under remote beca